---
description: Session Coach and Intra-Session Coach design rules for future AI guidance
alwaysApply: false
---

- AI coaching is a future subsystem, not part of the core workout truth.
- Split coaching into:
  - Session Coach: runs before/after workouts and between sessions
  - Intra-Session Coach: evaluates after each completed set during a live workout
- Intra-Session Coach must be deterministic first:
  - rep drop-off
  - missed targets
  - long or short rest vs target
  - unusual fatigue pattern
- LLM-generated text should explain recommendations, not invent the core recommendation.
- Store coach recommendations in dedicated tables and never let AI directly mutate set rows without an explicit user action.
